WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:05.180
We're at the second match of the district tournament.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.390
The first half ended,

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:11.020
but things didn't go as planned and we're in big trouble.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.960
All due to my miscalculations.{It was all my fault.}

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:18.660
Things just kept going downhill after that.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.570
Sorry, everyone.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:21.870
Shou!

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.170
Why do you think I made you captain?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.740
He has good field vision and great defensive positioning.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:32.380
Thanks to Coach Hanashima and everyone cheering me on,

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.650
I finally felt like I'm back.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:41.520
And we decided to use the three tactics we've practiced during the second half.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.920
After we get the ball back, make sure you use that loud voice and give us orders.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.690
Captain.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.460
We'll definitely turn this around!

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.030
Oh!

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.460
Suguro Special is not over yet!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.430
Forget about my mistakes.

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.400
We have to turn this around!

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.930
I don't care that I got a yellow card!{I won't be afraid just because I got a yellow card!}{Don't be afraid just because I have a foul!}

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:37.670
I need to keep it together!{I need to keep my act together!}{Get my act together!}

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.370
Focus!

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.250
Ouzou-kun!

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.250
Bastard!

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.550
Oh yeah! No whistle!

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:53.850
Shou!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.720
Onii-chan's amazing!

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:59.560
You're so cool, Shou! I've fallen for you again!

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:02.390
Yes! That's the way.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.730
Build!

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:10.500
Uchimura-kun!

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.880
To the left! Go!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.410
Interesting.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:22.480
They're bringing out something different from the first half.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:26.220
That kid's play is completely different from before.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.620
Looks like he woke up.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.720
His motivation's back, I guess?

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.230
Motivation? I see.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.060
Skill and ability can only take you this far.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:40.370
You need a certain amount of mental strength.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.370
Kota-kun's free!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.840
Look, look! A new attack!

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.780
Go!

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:56.880
Yes!

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.520
Yes!

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.350
All right!

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:00.920
Yeah!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.720
Yay!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.390
Yes, yes! We got a goal back! One goal!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.620
That hurts!

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.660
But we got a goal back!

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.890
Hehe!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.400
Saw that, Ginji?

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.570
It's just one goal.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:17.500
Don't worry too much about it! Just attack!

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:20.310
We're just getting started! Let's go!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.270
Okay!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.410
Suguro-kun's pretty good.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.510
He got everyone worked up so quickly.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:29.450
No wonder he's the captain!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.850
Nice shot.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.550
It was okay.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.860
Kota-kun, nice shot! It was amazing!

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:42.060
It's still too early to celebrate!{Now's not the time to celebrate!}

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.230
We're still losing.

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.530
Let's keep on attacking.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:48.330
Yup! Here comes our comeback!

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.500
Chances will come rolling in!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.190
It's here! The signal!

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:13.290
Suguro will do all his can to pass the ball.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.530
I'll stop his forward pass.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.870
You run towards his other passing lane.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.670
Idiots! You fell for it!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.650
What!?

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:35.880
Don't underestimate us!{Don't look down on us!}

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.250
We can't keep on falling for the same trick!

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.920
Nice cut, Erika-chan!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.420
Okay! Yoi!

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.360
Takatou-san!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.700
Yes! We did it!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.170
Oh! Nice chance!

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.600
You better make it, Uematsu-kun!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:01.440
I'll score! I'm a forward, too!

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:15.790
Yes! Tie game!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.620
We can win now, Hanashima-kun!

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:19.890
We will win.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.560
I always believed in you.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.030
Don't believe in me, believe in them.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.900
Kota! Good job!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.840
Uematsu, don't get disheartened!

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:30.770
Make sure you score next time!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.640
Yes!

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.930
Uchimura-kun! Get close to the ball!{Press the ball!}

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.930
Erika-chan! Mark Suguro-kun!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.940
Hey! Don't make such a bad pass!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.400
Crap!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.300
Now what should we do?

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.740
Ouzou-kun! Big Tri!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.910
That's right. No wonder you're the captain.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.830
Yes!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.300
We came back!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.770
Yes! We came back!

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:39.370
Don't get so excited yet. The show has just started.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.370
Well done, well done!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:42.040
How can I not be excited?

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.540
Did you see that?

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.550
Good job, Momoyama Predators!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.380
You're so cool, Shou!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:53.490
Mom! Onii-chan didn't score.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:56.020
Who cares? It's his team.

00:07:56.020 --> 00:08:00.430
Okay, everyone, we still have time. Let's keep on scoring!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:02.360
Oh!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:06.700
After we came back with Kota-kun's hat trick,

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:11.770
the Momoyama Predators began their dominance over Tsubakimori SC.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.070
Yoi!

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:22.710
Yes!

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.680
Uematsu-kun! Nice feint!

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:27.920
Yes! More! More!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:34.530
The game is completely dictated by our pace now.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.560
Let's go with Big Tri again!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.300
Okay! Let's go!

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.580
Why are they turning their backs on the goal?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.090
Pass it back and start again?

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.690
Sorry, but I'm the forward now!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.770
No way that's going in!

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.210
Yes! One more goal!

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:31.880
The game is not over yet!

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:42.590
Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:45.060
Don't tell me that was...

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.870
What's the matter?

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.740
Well, what do you think of that goal just now?

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.180
That goal?

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:04.820
Well... Not really pretty? It was an own goal.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:08.020
Did it seem like it was done on purpose?

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.760
Eh? On purpose? Impossible.

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:14.060
How should I assign a score to this?{How should I assign this a score?}{How should I score it?}

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:16.230
Um...

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:20.500
What? Are you using math now to dissect this game of soccer?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:24.200
To put it simply, yes.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.300
That sounds tough.

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:28.170
You're right!{Yeah!}

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.780
The whistle is about to blow.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:36.180
Let's run the clock down and win.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:40.450
Oh my, Tsubakimori became like West Sakuragawa.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.320
Dango soccer again?

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:44.560
Interesting.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.860
They were doing so well in the first half.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:50.700
How do I score them on their mental toughness...

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:55.070
Take the ball back! Don't give up!

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:56.970
No meaning in parking the bus!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.240
Ouzou-kun! Pass the ball around!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:07.080
Sorry, but our victory's decided.{Sorry, but victory is ours.}

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.810
So let's have some fun.{Let me have some fun.}

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:09.510
Huh?

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:14.750
Ouzou-kun is planning something.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:25.100
That fool.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:38.410
What's wrong? Come on.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:45.180
D-Don't look down on us!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:51.920
Press forward! Show them what we've got!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.430
So simple-minded. You fell for it!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.500
Erika-san!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.700
Eh? Me?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.870
Shoot from there!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.610
From this distance!?{All the way out here!?}

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.920
What!?

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.920
I-It went in!

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.360
Erika-san! Nice shot!

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.760
Takatou, nice!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:28.730
Wow! Nice long shot, Erika-chan!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.660
No way... I've never tried shooting it from this far before.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:38.140
Ouzou gave the ball away on purpose to free up the Dango soccer.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.810
I see.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:43.810
We win! We win!

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:45.080
Congratulations!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.010
Yes!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.080
Yes!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:47.550
All right!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.450
We won!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.320
We won! We won!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.080
We did it.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.820
Yeah.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:58.490
Hey.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:02.790
What?

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.270
What do you want!?

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.540
It was pretty fun playing you guys.

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:11.670
Let's play again.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.910
Please keep this up.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.340
Thank you very much.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.710
Thank you very much!

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:26.750
Good job.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.720
Good job! Good job!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:29.990
Good work!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.390
Well, it's great that they won.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.390
Hey.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.060
What's wrong?

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.970
No, it's nothing.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.600
Kota, you got a hat trick.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:44.540
Yeah.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.810
We won't let you get fired that easily.

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:52.210
You'll have to deal with us a bit longer.

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:53.650
Yeah.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.780
Hey! Ginji! How does it taste?

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:58.520
The skill of the Momoyama Predators!

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:01.290
Shut up!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.090
We're just not at top form right now!

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:07.460
The cries of a loser!

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.130
What did you say!?

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:12.130
You bastard!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:16.530
Come back again! We'll play you anytime!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:20.570
Stop that. You'll get lectured again.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:23.010
Coach of the Momoyama Predators.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:24.410
See?

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:27.480
I'm sorry. I won't let them fight again.{I'll stop their fight.}

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:30.320
That's not it. It's about the match.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.020
Eh?

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:34.490
Your team didn't really play the beautiful game, am I right?

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.820
More like, they didn't play like gentlemen.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:40.090
Not like gentlemen?

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.760
My kids?{They're just kids.}

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.160
That's right.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:47.170
I've heard about your team before, but today I saw with my own eyes.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.730
What do you mean?

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.570
They weren't just thinking about winning.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.910
How do I say this? They lack the class.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.140
Class?

00:14:56.140 --> 00:15:00.510
We followed the rules and defeated the opponent using our abilities.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.350
Isn't that what the game is about?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.420
Opponent?

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:10.620
I think the players you play against are still comrades on the pitch.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:14.590
And did they really play using their abilities?

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.360
Hey, that last pass...

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.760
That was Ouzou-kun.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:18.460
It was amazing.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:24.000
I just wanted to tell you that. See you.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:28.710
What "not like gentlemen"? That's just their personalities!

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:30.480
Um!

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:35.810
I'll beat those triplets in middle school.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:38.150
Please tell them that.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.020
Okay.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:52.000
Masaru-chan!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.400
Kin-chan wants to invite us all for yakiniku!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:55.470
Let's go, let's go!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.800
Kin-chan?

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.170
The manager!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.040
Oh...

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.640
To celebrate our victory, he said.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:05.680
We're at the semifinals and we beat Tsubakimori.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:07.950
I'll treat the entire team!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.650
Hurray!

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:13.820
Everyone! Change out of your clothes and 
meet up and Outa-kun's house in two hours.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:14.920
Okay!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.190
Sorry for the late introduction.

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:23.290
I'm Outa Shou's mother. Thank you for looking after my kid.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.200
Our family runs a restaurant.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:29.500
I'm his younger sister Suzu. Nice to meet you.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.570
Me, too. Nice to meet the two of you.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:35.640
Oh! It was that restaurant we passed by that one time. That one.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.710
Ah, I remember.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:39.640
Thank you very much.

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:43.280
I see Shou in a new light now.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:45.950
This is all thanks to you, Coach Hanashima.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.750
Well, I didn't really do anything.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:51.520
It's all due to Shou-kun's hard work.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:54.390
No way! He looks so different from before.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:56.830
Mrs. Outa, let's finish this later.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.230
I have to speak to him about his compensation.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.170
Let me join in on the conversation, too.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.670
Oh? Okay.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.240
Here you go.

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.310
Thank you.

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:16.010
Sorry! We aren't fully ready yet, so that's all we've got for now.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:21.350
Excuse us for coming on such short notice. Is there anything I can help out with?

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:25.720
Don't worry about that. My part timer's coming soon.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.890
You don't have to worry.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.600
It gets tougher if we have someone who's not experienced.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.430
Suzu! Come help out!

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:33.100
Okay!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:36.530
Hello!

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:38.770
Kumi-chan!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:43.110
There's a party today. It'll be tough, but please help out.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.240
Okay!

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.210
This is really good.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.850
Thank you very much.

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:51.150
This is enough for my meal!

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:51.780
Hey.

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:52.420
Hmm?

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.450
Who is this guy?

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.520
Rin-chan.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:56.420
Huh? Who's that?

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:59.390
Rin-chan is an amazing person!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:00.190
Huh?

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.860
Rin-chan's a math teacher.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.970
{I don't have to explain}Rather than explaining it myself - Rin-chan, bring that out!

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.270
Okay, okay.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.900
What's this?

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.340
It's soccer!

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:16.340
The whites and blacks are playing each other.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:21.080
On this pitch, the 22 players are playing at their own rhythms.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:24.650
In other words, they're playing to their strengths.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:30.390
You can see the buildup to the goal. That's what I look at.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:31.160
I see.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:33.060
Isn't he amazing?

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.790
Each player has their own personality.

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:37.530
Oh?

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:41.170
I teach math at the university,

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:46.370
but my kids roped me into the wonderful world of soccer.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.140
I see...

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.940
Rin-chan is Furuya-chan.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.140
Furuya-chan?

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.010
Yeah!

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:58.480
Furuya... So your sons are...

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:02.590
Yes! Kota, Ryuuji, Ouzou. Thank you for taking care of them.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:06.560
I'm their father, Furuya Rin.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.260
I'm Hanashima.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.160
Well, well...

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:13.130
I've been wondering who their father was like...

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:16.530
This guy is pretty strange.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.840
Isn't he interesting?

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.510
In any case, take a look at this.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:26.880
This is the own goal from Ouzou's play.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:34.490
You could say that this isn't very gentlemanly, or not really like children.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:40.460
Masaru-chan-san, what do you think about this as the coach?

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:45.300
They did those two plays on purpose, right?

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:47.230
The own goal, too?

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:49.270
Yes.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.140
They don't think about just winning.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:59.340
How should I say this? It's as if they lack class.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:07.220
What do you think? Does this type of play even warrant a score in soccer?

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.920
Score, you say?

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:10.720
Yes.

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:15.160
I need proper data for my simulations.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.030
Even if you say that...

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:20.430
Mom! I'm here to help out!

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:23.100
Coach, you're here!

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.740
What's the matter?

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:28.410
No, it's nothing.

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:36.710
The piano teacher is having a party?

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:41.220
Yes. So I probably won't need dinner tonight.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:46.490
Oh, is that so? Shouldn't you dress up, in that case?

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:51.330
That's fine! I'm always wearing this.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:55.130
Really? Then say hello to the teacher for me.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:58.070
I may take a visit soon.

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:00.270
O-Okay...

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:07.480
Ojou-sama, it's great that you won today.

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:08.610
Thank you.

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:12.120
Please enjoy the congratulatory party.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:16.150
But don't come home too late.

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.620
Your mother will be worried.

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:21.830
Okay. I'm off now.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:34.540
Take care.

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:42.210
Yes! That's when the game turned around!

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:39.140
Here, Onii-chan. Take care of this.

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:40.510
Okay! Leave it to me!

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:56.130
They did it on purpose? Why?

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:57.660
Good evening!

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:58.860
Thank you for having us.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:00.670
Welcome!

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:01.870
Oh! You're here!

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:06.840
The Furuyas said they are busy, so they aren't coming.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:09.140
Your sons aren't coming?

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.310
Perhaps they don't want to be with me.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.710
Eh? Everyone's families are here?

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:21.890
Hanashima-kun.

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:23.650
Hanashima-kun!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.960
Ah, yes!

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:26.860
What's wrong? You tired?

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:28.760
No, that's not it.

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:34.800
I've received the team fees from the parents, so everything is working out.

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:37.100
We can start the party now.

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:40.640
Before that, we want a word from you.

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:42.610
A greeting?

00:22:42.610 --> 00:22:44.710
Yes, of course.

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:45.740
Jeez.

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:48.410
Come on, everyone. Time for a toast!

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:52.420
Er, thank you for taking your time to come here today-

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:54.690
Uh...

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:56.890
Who is your child?

00:22:57.560 --> 00:22:59.220
Reika-chan!

00:22:59.790 --> 00:23:02.160
Mama! Why are you here!?

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:37.420
Is Reika-chan quitting soccer?

00:24:37.420 --> 00:24:38.520
That's impossible!

00:24:38.520 --> 00:24:40.620
She's not coming to school and she's not at home!

00:24:40.620 --> 00:24:42.630
Reika-chan! Come out!

00:24:42.630 --> 00:24:44.030
I have printouts from school!

00:24:44.030 --> 00:24:45.130
How will she come out?

00:24:45.130 --> 00:24:46.430
Oh! There she is!

00:24:46.430 --> 00:24:48.070
Just come and live at my house!

00:24:48.070 --> 00:24:50.230
You'll be part of our family now!

00:24:50.230 --> 00:24:52.340
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff!

00:24:52.340 --> 00:24:55.170
The Young Lady Covered in Mud.
